<i/>version {/17\.\d+/}
service timestamps debug datetime msec
service timestamps log datetime msec
<e/>vrf definition MGMT
<e/>aaa new-model
<e/>aaa authentication login default local
<e/>aaa authorization exec default local
<e/>username automation privilege 15 {/.*/}
<e/>ip domain name lab.internal
<e/>ip name-server vrf MGMT 10.100.0.1
no ip domain lookup
<e/>ip ssh server algorithm hostkey rsa-sha2-512 rsa-sha2-256
netconf-yang
restconf
<e/>ip http secure-server
ip http authentication local
<e/>ntp server vrf MGMT 10.100.0.1
<e/>ip route vrf MGMT 0.0.0.0 0.0.0.0 10.100.0.1
{d/}<e/>ip http server
{d/}<e/>username admin {/.*/}
{d/}<e/>no aaa new-model
